###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Forward (prequential) errors evaluate each model on configurations generated after its training data; the role is test with that meaning. Energy RMSEs and earlier updates are figure-only (Fig. 2; initial force RMSE about 98-103 meV/A).
# - The NPT and off-target HSE06 control models are not encoded separately. Nearest-neighbour distances, RDFs, coordination numbers and cell parameters (Table 1) are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/nagai2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

